                "retweet_count": 14,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "So much to say about Harris\u2019s thumping of Trump, but his ignorance about healthcare was pathetic. He said, \u201cIF\u201d there is a way to get better care for less money, he\u2019d propose it. Duh! Wouldn\u2019t we all do that? He had 4 years to find one but never even came up with a \u201cconcept.\u201d",
